{"story":{"id":"site-site-command-center","title":{"zh":"小行星防爆门","en":"Asteroid Blast Door"},"category":"precursors","kind":"site","image":"art/d63f9361bc2bc9cdd5ab.webp","start":"archaeological_site_types:site_command_center","chapters":5,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"与一个较小小行星的碰撞在[From.Planet.GetName]表面露出一个略微伸出的类似小型防爆门或者气闸室的东西。它似乎有着数千年的历史，先前一直被岩石和尘土所掩盖。\n\n由于未知原因，我们的扫描无法穿透到小行星的内部，并且常规切割工具也无法对防爆门造成影响。为了了解这扇门的背后有什么，我们的团队或许不得不从另一个方向向小行星的中心挖掘。","en":"A collision with a smaller asteroid has revealed a small blast door or airlock extending slightly from the surface of [From.Planet.GetName]. It appears to be thousands of years old, and had previously been concealed by rocks and dust.\n\nFor unknown reasons, sca"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:site_command_center","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"ancrel.6005","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:80"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.6010","parent":"n2","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.6015","parent":"n3","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n5"]},"n5":{"doc":"ancrel.6020","parent":"n4","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"archaeological_site_types:site_command_center","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"小行星防爆门","en":"Asteroid Blast Door"},"texts":[{"zh":"与一个较小小行星的碰撞在[From.Planet.GetName]表面露出一个略微伸出的类似小型防爆门或者气闸室的东西。它似乎有着数千年的历史，先前一直被岩石和尘土所掩盖。\n\n由于未知原因，我们的扫描无法穿透到小行星的内部，并且常规切割工具也无法对防爆门造成影响。为了了解这扇门的背后有什么，我们的团队或许不得不从另一个方向向小行星的中心挖掘。","en":"A collision with a smaller asteroid has revealed a small blast door or airlock extending slightly from the surface of [From.Planet.GetName]. It appears to be thousands of years old, and had previously been concealed by rocks and dust.\n\nFor unknown reasons, scans cannot penetrate the asteroid's interior and the blast door is impervious to conventional cutting tools. To learn what is behind this door, a team would likely have to dig their way towards the center of the asteroid from another direction."}],"sections":[{"zh":"与一个较小小行星的碰撞在[From.Planet.GetName]表面露出一个略微伸出的类似小型防爆门或者气闸室的东西。它似乎有着数千年的历史，先前一直被岩石和尘土所掩盖。\n\n由于未知原因，我们的扫描无法穿透到小行星的内部，并且常规切割工具也无法对防爆门造成影响。为了了解这扇门的背后有什么，我们的团队或许不得不从另一个方向向小行星的中心挖掘。","en":"A collision with a smaller asteroid has revealed a small blast door or airlock extending slightly from the surface of [From.Planet.GetName]. It appears to be thousands of years old, and had previously been concealed by rocks and dust.\n\nFor unknown reasons, scans cannot penetrate the asteroid's interior and the blast door is impervious to conventional cutting tools. To learn what is behind this door, a team would likely have to dig their way towards the center of the asteroid from another direction."}],"image":"art/d63f9361bc2bc9cdd5ab.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.6005","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:80","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"site-site-command-center"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29533","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8000"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29533","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"